    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The [[lookup @name lowercase]]{monster} flies up to its Fly Speed, shedding grave dust. Each creature within 5 feet of the [[lookup @name lowercase]]{monster} as it moves is targeted once by the following effect. <em>Constitution Saving Throw:</em> DC [[lookup @save.dc.value activity=iz2pE72ysvHjyizL]]. <em>Failure:</em> The target has the &amp;Reference[Blinded apply=false] condition until the end of the [[lookup @name lowercase]]{monster}'s next turn. <em>Failure or Success:</em> The [[lookup @name lowercase]]{monster} can't take this action again until the start of its next turn.</p>",
